<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head">Head for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Fairly easy choice with the head slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59449/lightweight-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is the best choice since you can pick your secondaries, has higher stat values and is a consistent pickup for everyone from a profession that's best in slot regardless.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
