<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>For shoulders, you'll want <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63463/mantle-of-the-eastern-lords">
<img alt="Mantle of the Eastern Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of the Eastern Lords</span></a>, it just has better secondary stats. The other two are relatively close but still worse.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
