<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back">Back for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>With cloaks, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56267/periwinkle-cloak">
<img alt="Periwinkle Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_b_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Periwinkle Cloak</span></a> is my recommended option, it performs a little better because the other two options of the same item level have critical strike rating and this one doesn't.<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a> is mentioned here, but because it's such a rare drop and with how expensive it'll be, I can't reasonably recommend it for a pre-raid best in slot set.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
