<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest">Chest for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Similarly to the cloak slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67133/dizzes-whirling-robe">
<img alt="Dizze's Whirling Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dizze's Whirling Robe</span></a> is also a listed here and a world drop, this means it's very rare and expensive, I don't recommend spending this much gold on an item you'll replace fairly quickly but it does perform better than other options slightly.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise, use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56267/periwinkle-cloak">
<img alt="Periwinkle Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_b_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Periwinkle Cloak</span></a>. The last two options listed are good temporary slot fillers but the critical strike on them (even if reforged) just leaves a lot of potential behind.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
