<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist">Wrist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Both of the wrist options have critical strike rating which is undesirable, but since haste performs better than mastery until you're haste capped which requires full pre-raid set, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56389/sand-silk-wristband">
<img alt="Sand Silk Wristband" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sand Silk Wristband</span></a> are recommended above its counterpart.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68786/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
