<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist">Waist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54503/dreamless-belt">
<img alt="Dreamless Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamless Belt</span></a> is the best in slot item here, you can either craft it, or buy the finished craft from someone - either way it's a great upgrade in comparison to heroic dungeon items since those both have critical strike rating on them.<br/>
<br/>Out of the two, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58154/pensive-legwraps">
<img alt="Pensive Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pensive Legwraps</span></a> is slightly better because haste tends to outperform mastery and on both you'll reforge the critical strike rating to either hit, haste or critical strike rating.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: The following enchants can be used simultaneously:<ul class="last">
