<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs">Legs for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>With leg options, they sadly all have critical strike, which you'll reforge into either hit, haste or mastery depending on the othe secondary the item has.<br/>
<br/>The crafted bind on equip <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54505/breeches-of-mended-nightmares">
<img alt="Breeches of Mended Nightmares" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of Mended Nightmares</span></a> are the pre-raid best in this slot, it's still fairly worth getting as long as you don't waste your entire budget on them.<br/>The other two options from heroic dungeons are both a fair bit worse, but <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58154/pensive-legwraps">
<img alt="Pensive Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pensive Legwraps</span></a> performs better than <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56413/legwraps-of-astral-rain">
<img alt="Legwraps of Astral Rain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of Astral Rain</span></a>. Considering the former is also easier to obtain, the choice is easy there.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54448/powerful-enchanted-spellthread">
<img alt="Powerful Enchanted Spellthread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_eternium.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Powerful Enchanted Spellthread</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75154/masters-spellthread">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Master's Spellthread</span></a> if <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif");'>Tailor</span>.</div></div>
