<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet">Feet for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Very few options for cloth non-spirit boots, thankfully, the best in slot is a reputation item so just aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62450/desert-walker-sandals">
<img alt="Desert Walker Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Desert Walker Sandals</span></a>.<br/>Until then, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56348/slippers-of-the-twilight-prophet">
