<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62416/yellow-smoke-pendant">
<img alt="Yellow Smoke Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Yellow Smoke Pendant</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62434/lightning-flash-pendant">
<img alt="Lightning Flash Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Flash Pendant</span></a> are the best in slot neck, it's obtainable through reputation so there's no need to worry about this slot. Until you get exalted, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52322/eye-of-many-deaths">
<img alt="Eye of Many Deaths" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of Many Deaths</span></a> is a bind on equip item that won't break your bank and performs better than other options with the same item level. <br/>
<br/>Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67130/dorians-lost-necklace">
<img alt="Dorian's Lost Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Lost Necklace</span></a> is listed below, but not recommended due to its cost and rarity.<br/>The other necks are ordered in terms of performance.<div class="pad"></div>
