<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62465/stump-of-time">
<img alt="Stump of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stump of Time</span></a> is the main recommended trinket for arcane, it's obtainable through reputation making it a easy pick-up. As for the second trinket slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62047/darkmoon-card-volcano">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Volcano" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_volcanocard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Volcano</span></a> is listed - this does perform better than other pre-raid options but unlike fire mage, it's not phase 1 best in slot - this makes it harder to realistically tell people to buy considering how expensive it'll be.<br/>If you are a player that'll play both speciailizations it's an obviously great value purchase, but if you're just going to play arcane, then you might want to consider your budget first.<br/>
<br/>The following trinkets are listed in terms of performance, with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56320/witching-hourglass">
<img alt="Witching Hourglass" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_khoriumpowercore.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Witching Hourglass</span></a> being the best trinket out of the heroic dungeon loot pool.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 23%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 22%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best</td>
