<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-1-pre-raid">Two-Handed  Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> is the pre-raid best in slot by a pretty wide margin, but sadly it's an incredibly rare drop from dwarf solving, if you get it congratulations - otherwise use one of the following two staves listed.<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62458/insidious-staff">
<img alt="Insidious Staff" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insidious Staff</span></a> is a purchasable from a reputation you'll be farming anyways for the exalted trinket, so just consider this as the baseline weapon and go from there.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
