<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-1-pre-raid">Off Hand Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57923/hermits-lamp">
<img alt="Hermit's Lamp" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_outlandraid_03orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hermit's Lamp</span></a> is easy to get from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> vendor, and performs better than the heroic dungeon alternative - if you end up using a one-handed weapon - just use this alongside it.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
